// Spell
@1 = ~Summon Dracockatrix~
@2 = ~Summon Dracockatrix
(Conjuration/Summoning)

Level: 2
Range: 30 ft.
Duration: 3 rounds + 1 round/level
Casting Time: 2
Area of Effect: Special
Saving Throw: None

This spell summons a dracockatrix, a small and vicious hybrid of a cockatrice and a black dragon, to fight for the wizard. It obeys the caster until the spell ends or it is slain.

Dracockatrix: HP 24, AC 5, THAC0 15, 1 bite per round (1d4 piercing damage and 1d4 acid damage). A creature bitten must save vs. Petrification/Polymorph or be slowed for 2 rounds as its flesh stiffens. The dracockatrix has 50% acid resistance.~

// Creature and its bite
@3 = ~Dracockatrix~
